#: apps/core/views.py:21
msgid "Is it safe to get dental treatment in Turkey?"
msgstr "Er det sikkert at få tandbehandling i Tyrkiet?"

#: apps/core/views.py:22
msgid ""
"Yes, when you choose a licensed clinic with experienced dentists and "
"certified materials. Ask for the dentist's credentials, the brands of "
"implants and crowns, and a written treatment plan before you travel."
msgstr ""
"Ja, når du vælger en godkendt klinik med erfarne tandlæger og certificerede "
"materialer. Spørg før rejsen om tandlægens kvalifikationer, mærker på "
"implantater og kroner og en skriftlig behandlingsplan."

#: apps/core/views.py:25
msgid "How much does dental treatment in Istanbul cost?"
msgstr "Hvad koster tandbehandling i Istanbul?"

#: apps/core/views.py:26
msgid ""
"Very affordable compared with Western Europe — with the same materials and "
"techniques. We do not publish one-size-fits-all prices: call us or send "
"photos on WhatsApp and you receive a fixed written quote before treatment "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"Meget overkommeligt sammenlignet med Vesteuropa – med de samme materialer og"
" teknikker. Vi offentliggør ikke standardpriser: ring til os eller send "
"billeder på WhatsApp, så får du en skriftlig fast pris, før behandlingen "
"starter."

#: apps/core/views.py:29
msgid "How long do I need to stay in Istanbul?"
msgstr "Hvor længe skal jeg blive i Istanbul?"

#: apps/core/views.py:30
msgid ""
"It depends on the treatment: fillings, cleaning and composite veneers take "
"1–3 days, crowns and porcelain veneers about 5–7 days, implants usually two "
"visits a few months apart."
msgstr ""
"Det afhænger af behandlingen: fyldninger, tandrensning og kompositfacader "
"tager 1–3 dage, kroner og porcelænsfacader cirka 5–7 dage, implantater "
"normalt to besøg med nogle måneders mellemrum."

#: apps/core/views.py:32
msgid "Do you speak my language?"
msgstr "Taler I mit sprog?"

#: apps/core/views.py:33
msgid ""
"We communicate with international patients in English and other languages, "
"and you can message the dentist directly on WhatsApp before, during and "
"after your treatment."
msgstr ""
"Vi kommunikerer med internationale patienter på engelsk og andre sprog, og "
"du kan skrive direkte til tandlægen på WhatsApp før, under og efter "
"behandlingen."

#: apps/core/views.py:35
msgid "How experienced is the dentist?"
msgstr "Hvor erfaren er tandlægen?"

#: apps/core/views.py:36
#, python-format
msgid "Our lead dentist has %(years)s years of clinical experience."
msgstr "Vores ledende tandlæge har %(years)s års klinisk erfaring."

#: apps/core/views.py:87
msgid "Dental Tourism Istanbul — Implants, Veneers & Crowns in Turkey"
msgstr "Tandlæge i Istanbul — implantater, facader og kroner i Tyrkiet"

#: apps/core/views.py:88
msgid ""
"Ethical dental treatment in Istanbul with an experienced dentist. Implants, "
"veneers, zirconia crowns — very affordable, fixed written quote. Free "
"WhatsApp consultation."
msgstr ""
"Etisk tandbehandling i Istanbul hos en erfaren tandlæge. Implantater, "
"facader, zirkoniakroner – meget overkommeligt, skriftlig fast pris. Gratis "
"rådgivning på WhatsApp."

#: apps/core/views.py:111
msgid "About Us — Ethical Dental Care in Istanbul"
msgstr "Om os — etisk tandpleje i Istanbul"

#: apps/core/views.py:112
msgid ""
"Meet the dentist and the clinic behind dentaltourism.tr: decades of clinical"
" experience, transparent diagnosis and only the treatment you actually need."
msgstr ""
"Mød tandlægen og klinikken bag dentaltourism.tr: årtiers erfaring, "
"gennemsigtig diagnose og kun den behandling, du virkelig har brug for."

#: apps/core/views.py:119 apps/seo/common.py:33
#: templates/components/footer.html:48 templates/components/navbar.html:55
msgid "About us"
msgstr "Om os"

#: apps/core/views.py:142
msgid "Please check the form and try again."
msgstr "Tjek formularen, og prøv igen."

#: apps/core/views.py:145
msgid "Free Consultation — Contact Our Dentist in Istanbul"
msgstr "Gratis konsultation — kontakt vores tandlæge i Istanbul"

#: apps/core/views.py:146
msgid ""
"Send your X-ray or photos and get a free treatment plan and fixed price "
"quote. Reply within 24 hours. WhatsApp, phone or form."
msgstr ""
"Send dit røntgenbillede eller fotos, og få en gratis behandlingsplan og et "
"fast pristilbud. Svar inden for 24 timer. WhatsApp, telefon eller formular."

#: apps/core/views.py:158
msgid "Thank you — we will contact you shortly"
msgstr "Tak — vi kontakter dig snarest"

