#: apps/seo/package_views.py:71
msgid ""
"Dental tourism packages in Istanbul — personalised, not one-size-fits-all"
msgstr "Tandrejser til Istanbul – personlige, ikke standardpakker"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:72
msgid ""
"Dental work is more than a Hollywood smile. Your package is built around a "
"real diagnosis: assessment, treatment, transfers, hotel and aftercare."
msgstr ""
"Tandbehandling er mere end et Hollywood-smil. Din pakke bygger på en ægte "
"diagnose: undersøgelse, behandling, transfer, hotel og efterbehandling."

