#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(treatment)s package in Istanbul built around your diagnosis: assessment, "
"treatment, transfer and hotel coordination, aftercare. Get your personal "
"plan on WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"%(treatment)s i Istanbul baseret på din diagnose: undersøgelse, behandling, "
"transfer og hotel, efterbehandling. Din personlige plan på WhatsApp."

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:132
#, python-format
